WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.545
[MUSIC]

00:00:01.545 --> 00:00:07.230
I went into SEP trying to expand my
understanding of business leadership.

00:00:07.230 --> 00:00:10.910
I've been in a technical leadership
role for many, many years.

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:15.340
So I was very interested in thinking
about how do I expand my horizon from

00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:17.320
technology to business leadership?

00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:20.110
Within a year coming back from SEP,

00:00:20.110 --> 00:00:26.335
I was given the opportunity to change
from VP of engineer role to a GM role.

00:00:26.335 --> 00:00:33.507
SEP, I really see it as a great catalyst
in the evolution of myself as a leader.

